            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/W%2A-algebra"} algebras
            is
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dual+equivalence"} dual
            to the category of
            %em compact strictly localizable
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enhanced+measurable+spaces"} enhanced measurable spaces
            = succeed "-algebras" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
